      "diff": "@@ -248,9 +248,9 @@ https://dev-libs.wireshark.org/windows/packages/[].\n \n [#ChLibsGcrypt]\n \n-=== Gcrypt\n+=== Libgcrypt\n \n-The Gcrypt Library is a low-level cryptographic library that provides\n+Libgcrypt is a low-level cryptographic library that provides\n support for many ciphers and message authentication codes, such as DES, 3DES,\n AES, Blowfish, SHA-1, SHA-256, and others.\n \n@@ -261,7 +261,7 @@ AES, Blowfish, SHA-1, SHA-256, and others.\n \n If this library isn't already installed or available as a\n package for your platform, you can get it at\n-https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/Libgcrypt[].\n+https://gnupg.org/software/libgcrypt/[].\n \n [#ChLibsWindowsGcrypt]\n \n",
